summary:
  A station's saved new address never reaches the alarm set on it.

history:
  The heal road saved a moved station's new address to the list while the
  alarm on that station kept its own copy of the dead one: every morning
  started at the dead address and had to win the whole heal ladder again
  inside the fallback tone's 25 seconds. Found by reading the heal road
  end to end on 2026-09-21; this takes the call away again.

target:
  package/contents/ui/main.qml

find:
          alarmEngine.retargetStation(oldUrl, newUrl);

replace:
          void 0;

expect:
  Killed by test_invariants::test_a_saved_new_address_reaches_the_alarm_and_the_scheduled_recording.
  Line-neutral.
